Package: crsgrid
Title: Portable Grid Specs for Any CRS
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads crsgrid specs (a family of CRS instances sharing one
    lattice, with a domain and an ID scheme) and implements the portable
    operations: tile at a point, tile extent, IDs, parents and children,
    and domain checks. Reference R runtime, held to the JSON fixtures in
    the crsgrid repository.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    gdalraster,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    arrow,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
